# NOTE: wall.py is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Both copies are teaching specimens the README links directly:
#   wall.py                              -- raw model output, ~150 lines, passes
#   plugin_set/src/compas_studio/wall.py -- the reviewed 20-line version
# "Correct is not good" (README section 4) needs both to exist.
# tdd_agent.py overwrites the first one; that shows up as a diff, which is the
# point -- compare what your model wrote against the committed reference.
